      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَّاعٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْمَعٌ</span></b>  [are mentioned together, but
not explained, in the TA: the former signifies,
and probably, judging from analogy, the latter
likewise, as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمُوعٌ</span></b> , <i>One who collects much;</i>
or <i>who collects many things</i>]. ― 
